# Firebase client config (FR-ACC-08). Not a technical secret — Google's own
# guidance is that these are safe to commit — but kept out of git anyway,
# same treatment as FIREBASE_WEB_API_KEY on the backend: not hardcoded/
# committed even though not literally secret. Each developer downloads
# their own copy from the Firebase Console (same project, same values for
# everyone) — see the root README's "Running the mobile app" section.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
